  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NDC- Cultural organisations, E.Jerusalem 2016-2020</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">NDC- kulturella organisatioiner, &#xd6; Jerusalem 2016-2020</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Syftet med denna insats &#xe4;r att st&#xf6;dja kulturinstitutioner i &#xf6;stra Jerusalem d&#xe5; den politiska situationen har lett till att m&#xe5;nga organisationer har tvingats att flytta eller st&#xe4;nga. Genom att fr&#xe4;mja kulturella r&#xe4;ttigheter i &#xf6;stra Jerusalem fr&#xe4;mjas palestiniernas aktiva n&#xe4;rvaro i &#xf6;stra Jerusalem. Syftet &#xe4;r ocks&#xe5; att st&#xf6;dja en i h&#xf6;g grad f&#xf6;rsummad sektor som, om den st&#xe4;rks, kan bidra till att ge en r&#xe4;ttvisande bild av palestinier och det palestinska samh&#xe4;llet.

NDC har ans&#xf6;kt om ett belopp p&#xe5; 42 msek f&#xf6;r att genomf&#xf6;ra programmet K&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;d till kulturorganisationer i &#xf6;stra Jerusalem under 2016-20.

Insatsen syftar till att 1. st&#xf6;dja institutioner i &#xf6;stra Jerusalem att utveckla sin motst&#xe5;ndskraft genom mer stabil och f&#xf6;ruts&#xe4;gbar finansiering; och 2. ge st&#xf6;d till en f&#xf6;rsummad sektor med stor betydelse f&#xf6;r palestinsk identitet och f&#xf6;r bilden av Palestina.

Insatsens totalbudget &#xe4;r 42 msek d&#xe4;r ca 33,5 msek kommer att &#xf6;verf&#xf6;ras till fem kulturinstitutioner I form av k&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;d.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this action is to support cultural institutions in East Jerusalem, because the political situation has led to many organizations closing down. By promoting cultural rights in East Jerusalem Palestinians will be able to promote Active Presence in East Jerusalem. The aim is to support a largely neglected sector, so that it is strengthened, and can help to give an accurate picture of the Palestinians and the Palestinian society.

NDC Has applied for an amount in SEK 42 million to conduct cultural program Core Support for cultural organizations in East Jerusalem in 2016-20.

The initiative aims1. to support the institutions in East Jerusalem in developing the resilience through more stable and predictable financing; and 2. provide support for a neglected sector of importance for the Palestinian identity and image of Palestine.

Contributions total budget is 42 million where approximately 33.5 MSEK will be transferred to five cultural institutions as core support.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The stated goal of the Project is to Support the resilience of Palestinian community in East Jerusalem through the promotion of cultural rights. While its strategic objective is to Empower the Palestinian arts CSOs to continue and expand providing cultural services in East Jerusalem.

Outcome One: the establishment of&#xa0; Jerusalem Arts Network , Shafaq the network of specialized cultural CSOs in East Jerusalem&#xa0;&#xa0;

Outcome Two: Enhanced cooperation partners sustainability&#xa0;

Outcome Three: Enhance cooperation between cooperation partners (CSOs) and other development partners (private and public sectors).</narrative>
  </description>
